# PRQL: PRQL language book (prql-lang.org); requirements/languages/prql.md
name     prql
keyword  from select filter derive group aggregate sort take join window let func into case
builtin  true false null sum count average min max this that
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes interp=braces
string   ' '  : escapes
prefix   f s r
operators  +-*/%=<>!&|~.:
